1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,764
There is a world where
it may rain iron.

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:05,455
On Earth, rain is water.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,383
But on Titan, a moon of Saturn,
it is far too cold for that.

4
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:14,574
So there, methane fills the
clouds, the rivers, and the seas.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:15,935
Now go hot.

6
00:00:15,935 --> 00:00:19,293
On this distant planet,
metal turns to vapor.

7
00:00:19,867 --> 00:00:23,370
Strong winds carry iron vapor
to the cooler night side.

8
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:27,649
And there, scientists suspect,
it falls as iron rain.

9
00:00:28,283 --> 00:00:28,601
Rise.

10
00:00:28,601 --> 00:00:28,920
Cool.

11
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:29,238
Fall.

12
00:00:29,238 --> 00:00:31,435
The same steps, on every one.

13
00:00:32,033 --> 00:00:34,022
Different world, different rain.
